genetics-printer-title = Genetic printer
genetics-printer-help = Insert a recorded disk and select a block to produce an injector. You can also print an injector of the entire sample: it replaces all of the recipient's blocks when injected. Printing requires unstable mutagen. Resetting blocks and erasing the sample only affect the disk recording.
