ent-GeneticInjectorBrittle = brittleness genetic injector

genetics-gene-night-vision = Night vision
genetics-gene-night-vision-desc = Allows you to focus your eyes and make out objects in the dark.
genetics-feeling-night-vision = Your pupils widen. Previously invisible shapes emerge from the shadows.
genetics-gene-clotting = Accelerated clotting
genetics-gene-clotting-desc = Helps stop bleeding sooner. It does not replace lost blood or heal wounds.
genetics-feeling-clotting = An unfamiliar warmth spreads beneath your skin, and small scratches tighten at the edges.
genetics-gene-jump = Reflective skin
genetics-gene-jump-desc = Toughens the surface of your body, allowing it to occasionally deflect incoming projectiles and beams.
genetics-feeling-jump = A wave of tension passes over your skin. Its surface feels unusually springy and smooth.
genetics-gene-pouch = Biological pouch
genetics-gene-pouch-desc = Forms an additional pocket for a small item, accessible directly from your inventory. The item falls out when the pocket disappears.
genetics-inventory-pocket = Biological pocket
genetics-feeling-pouch = Something shifts beneath your abdominal skin, forming a soft fold with a cavity inside.
genetics-gene-insulation = Electrical insulation
genetics-gene-insulation-desc = Prevents your tissues from conducting electric current. Other means of stunning still work.
genetics-feeling-insulation = A dry tingling runs across your skin. Your hair briefly stands on end.
genetics-gene-glow = Bioluminescence
genetics-gene-glow-desc = Allows you to illuminate your surroundings with a gentle bodily glow at will.
genetics-feeling-glow = Tiny glowing specks emerge beneath your skin, responding to your breathing.
genetics-gene-hearing = Keen hearing
genetics-gene-hearing-desc = Allows you to briefly focus on signs of nearby life, even through walls.
genetics-feeling-hearing = The familiar hum separates into distinct sounds. You hear the quiet rhythm of your own heart.
genetics-gene-web = Web glands
genetics-gene-web-desc = Allows you to leave durable, sticky webs. Producing silk consumes nutrients, and you can only maintain a limited number of webs.
genetics-feeling-web = Sticky secretions coat your fingers and stretch into thin strands.
genetics-gene-fire-breath = Fire breath
genetics-gene-fire-breath-desc = Allows you to breathe a burning glob over a short distance. It is exhausting; sealed protective helmets block it.
genetics-feeling-fire-breath = Your throat grows hot. An acrid, fuel-like taste lingers on your tongue.
genetics-gene-hemophilia = Hemophilia
genetics-gene-hemophilia-desc = Damaged blood vessels bleed more heavily than usual.
genetics-feeling-hemophilia = Your mouth tastes metallic, and your gums feel sore.
genetics-gene-photophobia = Photophobia
genetics-gene-photophobia-desc = Brightly lit surroundings appear glaring and washed out; this sensation fades in darkness. Your vision takes longer to recover from flashes, though eye protection still helps against them.
genetics-feeling-photophobia = The light hurts your eyes. You want to squint and look away from the lamps.
genetics-gene-hypermetabolism = Hypermetabolism
genetics-gene-hypermetabolism-desc = Your body consumes nutrients faster and needs food more often.
genetics-feeling-hypermetabolism = Your stomach growls loudly. Your sense of fullness rapidly fades.

genetics-ability-recovering = Your body needs time to recover.
genetics-ability-hungry = You are too hungry for that.
genetics-web-limit = You cannot maintain any more webs. Remove some of your previous strands first.
genetics-web-occupied = There is already a web here.
genetics-fire-sealed = Your protective helmet prevents you from freely exhaling flame.
genetics-hulk-cannot-shoot = Your thickened fingers cannot work the tiny firing mechanism.

ent-ActionGeneticNightVision = Focus vision
    .desc = Adapt your eyes to the dark or return to normal vision.
ent-ActionGeneticGlow = Glow
    .desc = Make your body glow softly or extinguish its light.
ent-ActionGeneticHearing = Listen closely
    .desc = Briefly focus on signs of nearby life. Your hearing will need a rest afterwards.
ent-ActionGeneticWeb = Release web
    .desc = Leave a durable, sticky web beneath your feet.
ent-ActionGeneticFireBreath = Breathe fire
    .desc = Spit a burning glob in the chosen direction. Catch your breath before trying again.

